import type{Metadata}from'next';import Image from'next/image';import Link from'next/link';import{notFound}from'next/navigation';import PromptCustomizer from'@/components/PromptCustomizer';import PromptCard from'@/components/PromptCard';import{promptItems}from'@/lib/prompts';
export function generateStaticParams(){return promptItems.map(p=>({id:p.id}))}export async function generateMetadata({params}:{params:Promise<{id:string}>}):Promise<Metadata>{const{id}=await params,p=promptItems.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!p)return{};return{title:`${p.title} Prompt — Free ${p.model} Template`,description:p.summary,alternates:{canonical:'/prompts/'+p.id},openGraph:{images:[p.image]}}}
export default async function PromptPage({params}:{params:Promise<{id:string}>}){const{id}=await params,p=promptItems.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!p)notFound();const related=promptItems.filter(x=>x.id!==p.id&&(x.category===p.category||x.tags.some(t=>p.tags.includes(t)))).slice(0,3);const guide:{[k:string]:string}={Professional:'Professional portraits succeed when identity accuracy, natural skin and industry-appropriate presentation come before dramatic styling.','E-commerce':'Commercial product imagery must attract attention without misrepresenting geometry, color, packaging or included parts.','Photo Editing':'Believable editing depends on consistent perspective, light direction, edge detail, color temperature and contact shadows.',Content:'Content visuals need one clear promise, a strong focal point and hierarchy that remains readable on a phone.'};return <><section className="promptDetail"><div className="detailVisual"><Image src={p.image} alt={p.title} width={1000} height={1250} priority/><Link href="/prompts">← All prompts</Link></div><div className="detailBody"><div className="breadcrumbs"><Link href="/">Home</Link><b>›</b><Link href="/prompts">Prompts</Link><b>›</b><span>{p.title}</span></div><span>{p.category} · {p.model}</span><h1>{p.title}</h1><p>{p.summary}</p><PromptCustomizer p={p}/><div className="useTips"><h2>How to use it</h2><ol><li>Replace the variables using the fields above.</li><li>Copy the completed prompt into {p.model} or a compatible model.</li><li>Review at full resolution and adjust one decision at a time.</li></ol></div><div className="editorialGuide"><span>EDITORIAL GUIDANCE</span><h2>Getting a result you can use</h2><p>{guide[p.category]||'Treat this template as a controlled creative brief. Preserve critical source details, make one major change at a time and inspect the final result before commercial use.'}</p><h3>Common mistakes</h3><p>Avoid vague quality words, conflicting styles and large generic negative-prompt lists. State the result, protected details and final placement clearly.</p><p className="reviewNote">Model behavior changes over time. Review identity, anatomy, text, labels, reflections and rights before publishing.</p></div></div></section><section className="related"><span>CONTINUE EXPLORING</span><h2>Related prompt systems</h2><div className="relatedGrid">{related.map(x=><PromptCard p={x} key={x.id}/>)}</div></section></>}
